New: Already-imported decks can now be updated when the online version changes (e.g. new species) — without losing your review progress.
New: Before downloading the species database, the app now shows the approximate size, with an extra warning when you're on cellular.
New: First-run setup now leads straight into a full-screen deck picker instead of a welcome dialog.
New: Edit Deck now has a delete button, so you no longer have to go back to the deck list to swipe-delete a deck.
